    "decision": "Approved the 384-file closure after independent review of the sole workflow delta from 8ad11ad: the docs job downloads the Python 3.11 qualified wheel only when the runtime job did not succeed, preserving the existing Python 3.13 runtime-wheel preference when both prerequisites succeed. The independent review checked all 384 file identities, 144 routing states, five actual Bash controls and 39 classifier tests with no findings. Native, vendor, consumer, schema, fixture, test and qualification-policy bytes are unchanged. Prior source reviews remain historical authority for the unchanged implementation; this approval does not transfer earlier artifact evidence. Fresh exact-head CI and artifact reconciliation remain required. No merge, issue closure or Checkpoint B acceptance is implied.",
